Oh, I know.

35
00:02:49,330 --> 00:02:50,540
You know what?

36
00:02:50,710 --> 00:02:53,540
I never would've gotten this if it weren't for you.

37
00:02:53,710 --> 00:02:57,250
No, really. When I'm with you, I'm like...

38
00:02:57,420 --> 00:03:00,170
...this whole other guy. I love that guy!

39
00:03:00,430 --> 00:03:02,510
I mean, I love you too. A lot.

40
00:03:02,720 --> 00:03:04,930
But that guy!

41
00:03:05,100 --> 00:03:06,510
I love that guy!

42
00:03:06,680 --> 00:03:08,520
I love both of you.

43
00:03:11,600 --> 00:03:13,690
I wish I didn't have to go.

44
00:03:14,520 --> 00:03:15,770
Then don't.

45
00:03:15,980 --> 00:03:18,650
Stay here. Don't go so soon to London.

46
00:03:18,860 --> 00:03:20,190
Just one more day.

47
00:03:18,860 --> 00:03:20,190
Oh, Ross.

48
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:22,610
One more day.

49
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:22,610
Please don't do this to me again.

50
00:03:23,490 --> 00:03:27,490
You know I'd stay, but I've already missed so much work. They'll fire me.

51
00:03:27,660 --> 00:03:30,870
So? Then you could stay as long as you want.

52
00:03:31,830 --> 00:03:33,290
I wish I could.

53
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:37,460
Oh, no, don't... Don't... Don't start packing.

54
00:03:37,710 --> 00:03:39,420
Come on.

55
00:03:42,090 --> 00:03:43,970
I don't think you understand packing.

56
00:03:45,720 --> 00:03:48,100
I don't want to leave it till the last minute.

57
00:03:48,260 --> 00:03:50,890
Last time I packed in a rush, I left my knickers here.

58
00:03:51,060 --> 00:03:53,980
Yeah, I know. I, uh, tried them on.

59
00:03:54,650 --> 00:03:56,020
You didn't!

60
00:03:56,190 --> 00:03:58,730
No, I didn't. I didn't want to be "that guy."

61
00:04:07,910 --> 00:04:09,450
Hello.

62
00:04:11,250 --> 00:04:12,290
Ho, ho, ho.

63
00:04:13,920 --> 00:04:16,420
Excuse me?

64
00:04:13,920 --> 00:04:16,420
Your pants.

65
00:04:16,580 --> 00:04:18,840
Oh, yeah! You like them?

66
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:22,460
I went to a used-clothes store and got maternity stuff.

67
00:04:22,630 --> 00:04:25,510
These are so comfortable.

68
00:04:27,850 --> 00:04:31,600
Uh, Pheebs, those are, uh, Santa pants.

69
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:34,890
What?

70
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:34,890
Santa pants.

71
00:04:35,850 --> 00:04:37,600
Santa Claus' pants.

72
00:04:39,190 --> 00:04:41,440
Nuh-uh. They're maternity pants.

73
00:04:41,610 --> 00:04:44,990
They even came with a list of baby names. See?

74
00:04:45,150 --> 00:04:48,240
These names are good, and these are bad.

75
00:04:52,700 --> 00:04:54,580
Hey!

76
00:04:52,700 --> 00:04:54,580
Hey.

77
00:04:54,750 --> 00:04:56,040
Hey, Pheebs.

78
00:04:56,580 --> 00:04:58,880
So, how are the elves?

79
00:05:00,090 --> 00:05:04,380
I don't know. How are the, uh, you know?

80
00:05:05,930 --> 00:05:08,010
Your clothes aren't funny.

81
00:05:09,550 --> 00:05:12,140
Hey, guys, what should I wear to a Knicks game?

82
00:05:12,680 --> 00:05:15,140
Uh, a T-shirt that says, "I Don't Belong Here"?

83
00:05:17,400 --> 00:05:18,480
You have tickets?

84
00:05:18,650 --> 00:05:23,030
Mom got Dad's season tickets in the divorce, so she gave them to me.

85
00:05:23,190 --> 00:05:25,400
Apparently, they're good seats.

86
00:05:25,570 --> 00:05:27,950
Oh, my God! Those are almost on the floor!

87
00:05:28,110 --> 00:05:29,820
Do you guys want these?

88
00:05:30,660 --> 00:05:32,370
Yeah!

89
00:05:30,660 --> 00:05:32,370
Yeah, we do!

90
00:05:32,910 --> 00:05:34,290
Well, you got them!

91
00:05:34,450 --> 00:05:36,660
All right!

92
00:05:34,450 --> 00:05:36,660
Just give us our apartment back.

93
00:05:40,750 --> 00:05:42,710
Whoa, I didn't see that coming.

94
00:05:44,590 --> 00:05:45,630
Are you serious?

95
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:49,590
Come on. We know what these are worth.

96
00:05:49,760 --> 00:05:51,850
Do you think we're stupid?

97
00:05:52,010 --> 00:05:55,390
Not stupid. You're meaner than I thought.

98
00:05:56,390 --> 00:05:57,930
What do you say?

99
00:05:56,390 --> 00:05:57,930
Forget it.

100
00:05:58,100 --> 00:06:02,020
Okay? I'm not giving up my bachelor pad for basketball seats.

101
00:06:02,190 --> 00:06:04,610
Your "bachelor pad"?

102
00:06:04,780 --> 00:06:06,780
Have you even had a girl here?

103
